# Run the browser simulator with FANSHELF_DEMO=1. All visible works are synthetic.
wait 500
expect Fanshelf
expect The Clockwork Garden
expect Лунная библиотека
expect updates unchecked
expect reading
expect Ready offline: 2 works
clean
shot shelf

tap The Clockwork Garden
expect A synthetic demonstration work.
expect Rating: Teen And Up Audiences
expect Warnings: No Archive Warnings Apply
expect New chapters found
expect Download new chapters
clean
shot work
# Checking for new chapters waits in the work's menu.
tap-id more
expect Check for new chapters
clean
shot work-menu
tap Back
expect-missing Check for new chapters

tap Shelf
tap A Field Guide to Small Hours
expect Updates never checked
clean
shot work-unchecked

tap Shelf
tap Updates
expect Update waiting to download
expect Never checked
expect Update all
clean
shot updates

tap Shelf
tap Filter
expect Fandoms
expect Public Domain Fairy Tales
expect Synthetic Library Stories
clean
shot fandoms

tap Public Domain Fairy Tales
expect The Clockwork Garden
expect All
clean
shot fandom-filter

tap All
expect A Field Guide to Small Hours

tap Manage
expect Remove downloaded copies
expect 2 on the reader
clean
shot manage

tap Remove downloaded copies
expect Remove 2 downloaded copies?
expect Reading places are kept
clean
shot manage-confirm

tap Go back
expect Remove downloaded copies
tap Shelf

tap Followed tags
expect Public Domain Fairy Tales
expect Synthetic Library Stories
clean
shot followed-tags

tap Public Domain Fairy Tales
expect Newest works in this tag on AO3
expect A Map Made of Starlight
clean
shot tag-feed

# A mistyped work stays on screen with the reason, and Back leaves.
tap Shelf
tap Add
wait-for Add an AO3 work
type nonsense
tap Open work
expect That is not an AO3 work address or number.
expect nonsense
clean
shot add-mistyped
tap Back
wait-for Followed tags
expect Ready offline: 2 works

# Following a tag is typed on the reader's keyboard and joins the list.
tap Followed tags
tap-id add-tag
wait-for Follow an AO3 tag
type opera
tap Follow
wait-for Tag followed
expect Public Domain Fairy Tales
expect opera
clean
shot tag-followed

# Without a network every request says how to fix it rather than hanging.
scenario offline
tap opera
wait-for Newest works in this tag on AO3
tap The Borrowed Compass
wait-for Join Wi-Fi
clean
shot lookup-offline
# Back from a failed lookup returns to the tag it was opened from.
tap Back
wait-for Newest works in this tag on AO3
expect The Borrowed Compass
tap Shelf
wait-for Followed tags
tap The Clockwork Garden
wait-for Download new chapters
tap Download new chapters
wait-for Join Wi-Fi
clean
shot download-offline
tap-id more
tap Check for new chapters
wait-for Join Wi-Fi
expect New chapters found
tap Shelf
tap Updates
tap Update all
wait-for This reader is not on Wi-Fi. Join Wi-Fi, then tap Update all again.
clean
shot update-all-offline
scenario normal

# Removing the downloaded copies keeps the works and their reading places,
# and the shelf stops claiming anything is ready offline.
tap Shelf
tap Manage
tap Remove downloaded copies
wait-for Remove 2 downloaded copies?
tap-id remove-copies
wait-for Removed 2 copies
expect 0 on the reader
clean
shot manage-removed
tap Shelf
wait-for Nothing is ready offline yet
expect The Clockwork Garden
expect not downloaded
clean
shot shelf-removed

# The shelf, the removal and the new tag survive the app closing.
restart
wait-for Fanshelf
expect Nothing is ready offline yet
expect A Field Guide to Small Hours
tap Followed tags
wait-for opera
tap Shelf

# Dates read the way a person says them, not as ISO stamps.
tap The Clockwork Garden
wait-for Chapters 13
shot work-dates
expect-missing 2026-09-01
tap Shelf
tap Followed tags
tap opera
wait-for Newest works in this tag on AO3
shot feed-dates
expect-missing 2026-09-02
